            </note>
            <note corresp="#d588-f2" n="2" xml:id="d588-f2-content">
                <p>A reference to the meetings in Paris of the Sixth Regular Session of the General
                    Assembly, Nov. 6, 1951, to Feb. 5, 1952.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
